# Oberon: The Programming Language Oberon (Oberon-07, revised 2016); requirements/languages/oberon.md
name     oberon ob obn

keyword  ARRAY BEGIN BY CASE CONST DIV DO ELSE ELSIF END FALSE FOR IF IMPORT IN IS MOD MODULE NIL OF OR
keyword  POINTER PROCEDURE RECORD REPEAT RETURN THEN TO TRUE TYPE UNTIL VAR WHILE
type     BOOLEAN CHAR INTEGER REAL BYTE SET
builtin  ABS ASR ASSERT CHR DEC EXCL FLOOR FLT INC INCL LEN LSL NEW ODD ORD PACK ROR UNPK

block-comment  (* *)  : nested
string   " "
number        : no-leading-dot
operators  +-*/=#<>&~:^|
calls
